  hints:
  - "Dani needs to reach somewhere high; she can't get there alone. Scarlet must find a way to bring her up."
  - "With Scarlet, press interact near Dani to lift her. Walk Scarlet to the base of the raised ledge and press interact again to set Dani down on top."
  - "Lift Dani onto the raised ledge, then switch to Dani and walk her north to the lever. Pull the lever to extend the bridge for Scarlet. Then bring Scarlet across and both stand on the glowing circle."
